[{"answer":"Good evening,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/1.mp3"},{"answer":"and in this week's edition of 'Focus on the Arts',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Jane Hemmington is going to fill us in on what's in store for us at this year's Summer Festival.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Over to you, Jane.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you, Geoffrey.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/5.mp3"},{"answer":"This year, the Summer Festival is the biggest we've ever seen,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/6.mp3"},{"answer":"so there should be something for everybody.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/7.mp3"},{"answer":"This is the third year they've run it and the timing's slightly different:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/8.mp3"},{"answer":"for the last couple of years it's been around the 5th to 17th,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/9.mp3"},{"answer":"but this year they wanted to allow everyone enough time to recover from the first of January celebrations","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/10.mp3"},{"answer":"and they've put it at the end of the month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/11.mp3"},{"answer":"The programme has sensational theatre, dance and also a large number of art exhibitions,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/12.mp3"},{"answer":"but the thing the Festival is most famous for is its great street music.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/13.mp3"},{"answer":"For today's report though, Geoffrey, I'm looking at some of the theatrical events that you might like to see;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/14.mp3"},{"answer":"in particular, at this year's theme - circuses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm going to tell you about two circus performances,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/16.mp3"},{"answer":"but there are plenty of others in the programme.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I've chosen these because they represent distinct movements within circus performance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/18.mp3"},{"answer":"The first is the Circus Romano from Italy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/19.mp3"},{"answer":"As this is a travelling circus,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/20.mp3"},{"answer":"it follows a long tradition by performing in a marquee -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/21.mp3"},{"answer":"which is really like a canvas portable building,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/22.mp3"},{"answer":"usually put up in a green space or car park,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/23.mp3"},{"answer":"rather than in a theatre or stadium.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/24.mp3"},{"answer":"In spite of this, Circus Romano isn't at all like the traditional circuses I grew up with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/25.mp3"},{"answer":"There are no animals - just very talented clowning and acrobatic routines.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/26.mp3"},{"answer":"The show has a lot of very funny moments, especially at the beginning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/27.mp3"},{"answer":"but the best part is the music and lighting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/28.mp3"},{"answer":"They're magical.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/29.mp3"},{"answer":"At forty-five dollars it's very expensive anyway -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/30.mp3"},{"answer":"it's really for adult tastes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/31.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, much of it would be wasted on children -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/32.mp3"},{"answer":"so I suggest you leave them at home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/33.mp3"},{"answer":"The second circus performance is Circus Electrica at the Studio Theatre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/34.mp3"},{"answer":"The purists are suggesting that this isn't a circus at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/35.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a showcase for skills in dance and magic,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/36.mp3"},{"answer":"rather than the usual ones you expect in a circus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/37.mp3"},{"answer":"With only six performers it's a small production, which suits the venue well -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/38.mp3"},{"answer":"the Studio only seats about 200 people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/39.mp3"},{"answer":"For my money, it's the aerial displays which are outstanding","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/40.mp3"},{"answer":"as well as the magical tricks -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/41.mp3"},{"answer":"features which are missing from Circus Romano.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/42.mp3"},{"answer":"An interesting feature of the show is that the performers are so young -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/43.mp3"},{"answer":"the youngest is only 14.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/44.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's still well worth seeing: a good one for the whole family.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/45.mp3"},{"answer":"And finally, as it's summer,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/46.mp3"},{"answer":"you may wish to see some of the Festival performances that are being presented outdoors.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Like the famous Mekong Water Puppet Troupe,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/48.mp3"},{"answer":"performing in the City Gardens this week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, water puppetry is amazing!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/50.mp3"},{"answer":"It's large puppets on long sticks,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/51.mp3"},{"answer":"controlled by puppeteers standing waist deep in the lake.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/52.mp3"},{"answer":"The puppets do comedy routines and there is some terrific formation dancing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/53.mp3"},{"answer":"This is a fantastic show and the best moment comes at the end -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/54.mp3"},{"answer":"seeing the puppeteers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/55.mp3"},{"answer":"When the troupe walks up out of the water, you get this amazing feeling.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/56.mp3"},{"answer":"It's really hard to believe that what you've been watching is lifeless wood and cloth.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/57.mp3"},{"answer":"As an adult, I had a great time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/58.mp3"},{"answer":"but I did note that other older people in the audience weren't quite as taken with it as I was.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/59.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a must for young children though,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/60.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's the audience it's really aimed at.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's all I've time for today,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/62.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'll be back next week with more news of what's worth seeing and what it's best to miss.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-2-2023-08-12-20-22-50/63.mp3"}]
